<BaseLayout title="How We Work">
  <h1>How We Work</h1>

  <p>
    Our work is relational, structured, and collaborative. It is not built on
    diagnosis, treatment plans, performance frameworks, or predefined goals.
    Instead, it is built on clarity, containment, and partnership.
  </p>

  <p>
    We don’t apply models to you. We work with you. The relationship itself is
    the method: attuned, intelligent, and grounded. You bring your lived
    experience; we bring our practice, analysis, and orientation. Together, we
    build something that actually fits your life rather than forcing you into a
    template.
  </p>

  <p>
    Our sessions are structured enough to feel safe, but spacious enough to feel
    human. We move between reflection, analysis, strategy, and meaning-making
    depending on what the moment requires. Nothing is scripted. Nothing is
    generic. Nothing is automated.
  </p>

  <p>
    This is not therapy, coaching, mentoring, consultancy, or friendship. It is
    a distinct relational practice designed for people who want depth without
    clinical framing, direction without hierarchy, expertise without
    impersonality, and warmth without boundary collapse.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
